# coach-logger flow
# SAFETY RULES (live-write hazards — DO NOT TRIGGER):
#   - NEVER `press select` while inside the Weigh-in number picker: it confirms a
#     LIVE weigh-in POST to the server. Enter the picker with select from the menu,
#     shoot it, then ALWAYS exit with `press back`.
#   - NEVER `press select` on a favorite row: it fires a LIVE meal POST.
#   Navigating the menu with up/down and shooting is safe.
app coach-logger
wait 8
shot menu-weigh-in          # menu top: Weigh-in row
press select                # enter Weigh-in number picker (no POST yet)
wait 2
shot weigh-in-picker
press back                  # EXIT picker WITHOUT confirming (no live write)
wait 1
press down
wait 1
shot favorite-1
press down
wait 1
shot favorite-2
press down
wait 1
shot favorite-3
press down
wait 1
shot voice-log             # last row: Voice log
